From 70b04e60e269b939bd3f4d27c1f0b4fdf83b021a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hiper25 <whydonit@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 22:59:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] drm: meson: add independent SC2 VIU1 OSD2 and OSD3 planes

Give each VIU1 RGB fetcher its own canvas, shadow, scaler, MAFBC surface and immutable blend order. Migrate OSD1 with aggregate decoder ownership so disabling or changing one surface cannot reset an active sibling. Preserve existing vblank/RDMA and framebuffer/fence retention, OSD1 singleton policy and full supported modifiers. Exact VIU2 output routing remains separate. Object build succeeds; actual surface acceptance is recorded separately.
---
